      "extract": "arXiv:1205.1453v2 [math.CA] 9 May 2012 An asymptotic formula of the divergent bilateral basic hypergeometric series Takeshi MORITA∗ Abstract We show an asymptotic formula of the divergent bilateral basic hypergeometric series 1ψ0(a; −; q, ·) with using the q-Borel-Laplace method. We also give the limit q →1 −0 of our asymptotic formula.",
