      "extract": "In this paper, we show an asymptotic formula of the divergent bilateral basic hypergeometric series $${}_1\\psi_0 (a;-;q;x ):=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}} (a;q)_n\\left\\{(-1)^nq^{\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}}\\right\\}^{-1}x^n.$$ Here, $(a;q)_n$ is the $q$-shifted factorial; $$(a;q)_n:= \\begin{cases} 1, &n=0, \\\\ (1-a)(1-aq)\\dots (1-aq^{n-1}), &n\\ge 1,\\\\ [(1-aq^{-1})(1-aq^{-2})\\dots (1-aq^n)]^{-1}, &n\\le -1 \\end{cases}$$ moreover,",
      "extractCut": true
    },
