      "extract": "In this section, we fix our notations. We assume that $0<|q|<1$ and $\\sigma_q$ is the $q$-difference operator such that $\\sigma_qf(x)=f(qx)$. The basic hypergeometric series is $$\\begin{aligned} {}_r\\varphi_s(a_1,\\dots ,a_r;&b_1,\\dots ,b_r;q,x)\\notag\\\\ &:=\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{(a_1,\\dots ,a_r;q)_n}{(b_1,\\dots ,b_s;q)_n(q;q)_n} \\left\\{(-1)^nq^{\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}}\\right\\}^{1+s-r}x^n. \\label{bh} \\end{aligned}$$ The radius",
